HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0512.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0513.fits,spectra0514.fits, spectra0515.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0516.fits,spectra0517.fits, spectra0518.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0519.fits,spectra0520.fits, spectra0521.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0522.fits,spectra0523.fits, spectra0524.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0525.fits,spectra0526.fits, spectra0527.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0528.fits,spectra0529.fits, spectra0530.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0531.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 1.033775182564779, 0.9933602558115712,0.9894571131865084,               HISTORY 1.0009618651394547, 0.9990399816768618,1.0866505541158078,              HISTORY 0.9945489797399725, 1.1291004277762042,1.060090917776988,               HISTORY 0.9643516863646533, 0.9829511611428282,1.0555492121696768,              HISTORY 1.112310554351211, 1.0294498073071392,1.049595267255344,                HISTORY 0.8794274992850538, 0.9209421742437403,0.9308621450057728,              HISTORY 1.0562299469565035, 0.9508614348508183.                                 END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             